Tutor: Hi, Lin. Where are you?
#objective: Say you're on your way
#chunks: I'm on my way.,Sorry, I'm running late.,Please wait for me. I'm almost there.,I'm here. Where are you?
#user_input
Tutor: Sorry, I'm running ten minutes late.
#objective: Say that's okay
#chunks: Sorry, I'm running late.,I'm on my way.
#user_input
Tutor: Please wait for me. I'm almost there.
#objective: Ask if they're near the station
#chunks: Please wait for me. I'm almost there.,I'm here. Where are you?
#user_input
Tutor: Yes, but the traffic is slow.
#objective: Say you're inside the café by the window
#chunks: I'm here. Where are you?,I'm on my way.
#user_input
Tutor: Okay. I'll arrive in five minutes.
#objective: Say no problem — you'll wait
#chunks: Please wait for me. I'm almost there.,I'm on my way.
#user_input
Tutor: No problem. I'll wait here.
#objective: Complete the arrival exchange
#chunks: I'm on my way.,Sorry, I'm running late.,Please wait for me. I'm almost there.,I'm here. Where are you?
#user_input
Tutor: Excellent! You can now update a friend when you're on the way or running late.
-> END
